# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. The Supabase *publishable* key is committed in index.html on purpose
# — row-level security is what makes that safe. The *service_role* key is not:
# it bypasses RLS entirely and lives only in Apps Script Script Properties.
# Nothing resembling an env file should ever reach this repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets.json
service-account*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies. Playwright is ~19MB and is only used by the tests — the site is
# static and has no runtime dependencies at all.
#
# Only the ROOT lockfile is ignored: Netlify runs `npm install` whenever it
# finds one in the base directory, which would make a no-build static site
# start installing packages. tests/package-lock.json is fine to commit and
# pins the test tooling.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
/package-lock.json
/package.json
/yarn.lock
/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Python, for the same reason: a root requirements.txt makes Netlify run pip.
/requirements.txt
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test output and scratch files.
# `tests/_*.js` is the convention for throwaway probes — anything prefixed with
# an underscore is a one-off and should not be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tests/_*.js
tests/*.png
tests/screenshots/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build / host
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.netlify/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client working material. The written record is worth keeping; the raw audio
# is a 1MB voice memo that does not belong in source control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
client_feedback/*
!client_feedback/*.txt
!client_feedback/*.md
